			<div class="content">
				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					<img class="img-fluid rounded d-block mx-auto" src="https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/dba27240-d9c5-494a-ba66-de8d276e7e17_The%2BAdventure%2BCorps%2Bphoto.jpg" style="display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="col col-md-8 col-sm-12">
			<div class="content">
				<h5 style="text-align:center;">The Adventure Corps</h5>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					Is a character-building program designed for boys in grades 1-8. Adventure Corps is a faith-based community program focusing on the physical, mental, and spiritual growth needed in males today. Adventure Corps is an important aspect of Corps ministry that could provide a Corps with a strong young male church base.&nbsp;
				</p>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					<strong>To learn more about our scouting and youth ministry programs,</strong>
				</p>

				<p style="text-align:center;color:#fff;">
					Call <a href="tel:+12253554483" target="">225-355-4483</a> x.401
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>
